# Keep the build context tiny: only the files the Dockerfile COPYs.
# The build context is code/benchmark/docker/ — never the repo root — so the
# repo, data/, and data/references/ are NOT part of any image layer.
*
!Dockerfile
!requirements-pinned.txt
!install_r_packages.R
!entrypoint.sh
!init-firewall.sh

# By default the Stata installer tarball and license are NOT sent to the build
# context (the Stata block in the Dockerfile is commented out). To build a
# Stata-enabled image, add the artifacts under stata/ and un-ignore them here:
#   !stata/Stata18Linux64.tar.gz
#   !stata/stata.lic
# Never push/share a resulting image: it embeds a node-locked Stata license.
